Task: 04
Title: Shared tool implementations (`src/shared-tools.ts`)
Phase: 1
Route: full
Slice: Foundation
Dependencies: 03
Scope: Implement the two custom tools that stage orchestrator subagents use: `qrspi_dispatch` (wraps `Symbol.for("pi-subagents:manager")` to access AgentManager for sub-subagent spawning — supports foreground via `AgentManager.spawnAndWait()` and background via `AgentManager.spawn()`, with graceful fallback when pi-subagents is not installed) and `qrspi_question` (wraps `ctx.ui.confirm()` and `ctx.ui.select()` for interactive user prompts). Both tools return structured text results parseable by the orchestrator.
Acceptance Criteria: AC 5 (graceful degradation on missing pi-subagents)
NFRs: NFR: Compatibility (graceful fallback for missing pi-subagents)
Gate Criteria: Phase 1 replan gate (tools functional)
Files:
  - src/shared-tools.ts (CREATE) — Functions: createDispatchTool(ctx), createQuestionTool(ctx). Types: DispatchParams, QuestionParams, DispatchResult, QuestionResult. Registration helpers for pi extension activate().
